  "notes": [
    "pi.commandPath / pi.extraArgs / pi.providers are Coda settings, not Pi settings. Arbitrary pi.extraArgs and user extensions are outside this fixed dependency inventory.",
    "Extension signatures are compared across snapshots. Declaration field checks verify consumed paths and coarse JSON types, not all TypeScript assignability.",
    "Tool names and args are heuristics with generic fallbacks. Text/image content uses type, text, data and mimeType. Error classifiers depend on provider wording and remain heuristic."
  ],
